    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Every spot inside the scene is the fork's generated layout, not an original one. Zone number 1204 is the fork's; ours must be assigned and the scene bs_cracked_claw_caverns has not been loaded by our server yet (the eleven shipped battles all use sg_random_encounter_clearing). Triggers: at-start spawns are actors, later waves follow the one before (the fork's 1.5 s delay is dropped). Knockouts and score are the design's defaults; coins and XP are the shipped battles' values, not the fork's 15 coins / 100 stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "The quest step and the wiki put 'Cray' in this fight; the fork's layout had 'swamp_cray' there. (R) 'Cray' takes those spots (wiki over the fork's roster)."
