    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: this scene needs one native load, and the starter or door of `entry` is drawn by the entrances work, not by this file. Each kind's rank here decides its health and hit at the fight's tier. Door actor 100000046215: reference Npcs.json Id 46215, model 251, name 71771, at [-2267.7, -29.35, 896.02]."
    },
